    {"ID": 131, "category": "Technology", "specialty": "Data Science", "Difficulty": "Medium", "Question": "What is the difference between Lasso and Ridge regression?", "Answer": "Lasso regression (L1 regularization) shrinks some coefficients to zero for feature selection, while Ridge regression (L2 regularization) reduces all coefficients but keeps them nonzero."},
