    {"ID": 157, "category": "Technology", "specialty": "Data Science", "Difficulty": "Medium", "Question": "What is the difference between weak AI and strong AI?", "Answer": "Weak AI is specialized for specific tasks, while strong AI has generalized intelligence similar to human cognition."},
