    {"ID": 191, "category": "Technology", "specialty": "Data Science", "Difficulty": "Medium", "Question": "What is the difference between episodic and continuous learning?", "Answer": "Episodic learning occurs in distinct learning sessions, while continuous learning updates the model in real-time as new data arrives."},
